<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Radiant Systems raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Radiant Systems raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it upgraded Radiant Systems Inc to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Cited solid fundamentals and the company's current valuation.</p>
<p>-- Maintained 12-month price target of $25 a share.</p>
<p>-- Radiant Systems launched its initial public offering Feb 13.</p>
<p>-- Shares gained 1 to 8-3/8.</p>
</text>
